---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import gate from '../../data/build-renewal-expansion-gate.json';
const items = gate.required_renewal_expansion_evidence;
---
<Layout title="BUILD Renewal / Expansion Readiness | BitEvo" description="Evidence-safe BUILD gate between measured value and renewal or expansion claims. Public readiness state is not customer, NRR or ROI evidence.">
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">BUILD · RENEWAL / EXPANSION READINESS · PUBLIC TEMPLATE ONLY</div><h1 class="display">Measured value is not renewal.</h1><p class="lede">The fixed USD 3,000 / five-business-day BUILD Workflow Exception Diagnostic can produce a bounded measured-value statement only when real evidence exists. That statement still does not prove that a buyer renewed, expanded scope, retained revenue or created NRR. Those claims require explicit buyer-authorized and commercial evidence bound to the same workflow and offer.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container panel" role="note"><strong>NO RENEWAL CLAIM · NO EXPANSION CLAIM · NO RETAINED REVENUE CLAIM · NO NRR CLAIM · NO ROI CLAIM</strong><p>This public template represents no customer state. Measured value, delivery or synthetic arithmetic cannot prove buyer intent, renewal, expansion, retained revenue, NRR, ROI or customer outcome.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Fixed BUILD offer</div><h2 class="section-title">One recurring exception workflow · USD 3,000 · five business days.</h2><article class="panel"><p>The commercial scope remains fixed. Any later renewal or expansion scope, price or term must come from explicit external commercial evidence and must not be inferred from this public template.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Renewal / expansion evidence gate</div><h2 class="section-title">Eight external-evidence conditions must hold before a renewal or expansion statement can be made.</h2>{items.map((item,index)=><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')} · {item.status}</div><h3>{item.label}</h3></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Current-state boundary</div><h2>No renewal or expansion state is represented.</h2><p><strong>measured_value_observed=false · renewal_expansion_evidence=false · renewal_committed=false · expansion_committed=false · retained_revenue_evidence=false · nrr_evidence=false</strong>.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Claim ceiling</div><h2>Measured value cannot substitute for a buyer renewal decision.</h2><p>No retained-revenue, NRR, ROI, customer-result, renewal or expansion claim is available from this public template. Any later statement must be bounded to explicit buyer authority and verified commercial provenance.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/build/measured-value-gate">Back to measured-value gate</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/proof">Open evidence ladder</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/build/renewal-expansion-gate.json">Open machine-readable gate</a></div></section>
</Layout>
